This repository contains NO model weights and NO redistributed third-party source
files. It ships configuration, launch scripts, runtime patch scripts and measurement
tools. The patch scripts modify an installed vLLM tree in place, at container start;
they do not embed vLLM source. See PROVENANCE.md for the exact upstream revisions the
patches are written against.

