overlay/mods/mtp-modelopt-mixed/run.sh implements two fixes first published in:

  Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-NVFP4-DGX-Spark
  https://github.com/tonyd2wild/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-NVFP4-DGX-Spark
  Copyright 2026 Tony DeAngelo (Tech2Wild / 2Wild). Apache License 2.0.
  (Reproduced verbatim from that repository's NOTICE, as Apache-2.0 §4(d) requires. The
  same author signs "Kai (Tech2Wild)" in its PROVENANCE.md.)
  Source file: single-spark-vllm-tp1/patch/upstream-overlays/modelopt.py,
  lines 1710-1722 (draft-local layer index) and 1780-1796 (FP8_BLOCK_SCALES MoE
  dispatch), as published 2026-09-05.

  Modifications made here, and why:
   - reimplemented as an in-place patch script rather than a redistributed overlay
     file, so that no vLLM source is shipped;
   - the draft-index parsing uses plain string operations instead of `re`, because
     the file we patch (vllm/model_executor/layers/quantization/modelopt.py) does not
     import `re`, and injecting an import would add a failure mode;
   - added an AST scope check: every name the injected code reads must be assigned in
     its host function, or the patch refuses.

  The same two fixes were published independently on the same day by sfxnz (MIT) and
  by MiaAI-Lab (AGPL-3.0). No code from either was used here.

